# MarQ Landing Page

MarQ is a modern and responsive React landing page designed to showcase brands, startups, products, and digital services with a clean and engaging user experience.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Built with React.js
- Fully Responsive Design
- Modern UI/UX
- Smooth Animations
- Fast Performance
- SEO Friendly
- Reusable Components
- Easy Customization
- Clean Code Structure

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- React.js
- JavaScript (JSX)
- CSS3 / Tailwind CSS
- Vite / CRA

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```bash
MarQ/
│
├── public/
├── src/
│   ├── assets/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── pages/
│   ├── App.jsx
│   └── main.jsx
│
├── package.json
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Zelesen/MarQ---landingpage
```

Go to the project directory:

```bash
cd marq
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start the development server:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Build for production:

```bash
npm run build
```

